  "prefLabel": "Site 102.22 Fragmentation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Site 102.22 “Fragmentation” means the loss of habitat that results from the division of relatively large, continuous habitats into smaller, more isolated remnants.\n\nSource. #9182, eff 6-17-08; ss by #10993, eff 12-16-15",
